            ns1:HashAlgorithm ;
        rdfs:label "sha1" ;
        rdfs:comment "SHA-1, a secure hashing algorithm, as defined in [RFC 3174](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/rfc3174/)."@en .

    <https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/HashAlgorithm/sha224> a owl:NamedIndividual,
